repository-code: 'https://github.com/cem-haussmann/FITToolbox.jl.git'
abstract: >-
  A Julia implementation of the Finite Integration Technique (FIT)
  for computational electromagnetics on structured, optionally
  non-equidistant grids. Provides the discrete topological
  operators, material matrices, boundary conditions, and field
  reconstruction on the staggered primal-dual grid pair.
keywords:
  - computational electromagnetics
  - finite integration technique
  - FIT
  - Maxwell equations
  - Julia
